# Reference illustration — per-child secrets for `acme/gadget`.
#
# Read ONLY by this child's engine. The supervisor scrubs every other child's
# secrets (and the deployment-root GH_TOKEN) from this engine's env (#61), so the
# sibling `widget` child's ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is never visible here.
#
# In a real workspace this lives inside the child repo and is gitignored by the
# child. Copy to `.env` and fill in; never commit the real `.env`.

# --- Required: this child authenticates every `gh`/git call with its own token ---
GH_TOKEN=

# --- Provider key: this child's defaultProvider is `cursor` ---
CURSOR_API_KEY=
